This contains a Overpowered kit for anyone who has creative mode access anywhere (including on public servers) Follow these simple steps to get this overpowered kit: 

1 - Download the Release of my hotbar.nbt file

2 - press Win+R on your keyboard and type "%appdata%", then press enter

3 - look for the ".minecraft" folder near the top and double click on it

4 - drag the hotbar.nbt file you downloaded into the .minecraft folder, make sure to click anything saying "replace the file in the destination"

5 - go into minecraft, go to the singleplayer world/multiplayer server you want the kit in, and enter creative mode.

6 - in creative mode, go to your creative menu by pressing E, then find the section in the top right corner with the bookshelf icon, click on it, and drag the chest at the top of the menu into your inventory.

7 - Finally, place the chest down, take one of the shulkers out, and place that down, look in the shulker for all of the loot.

NOTE - DM me on discord if you want anything added or have any issues. Discord user: Barbecuemonk
